==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Relic Doge Base (Enemy Base)|Relic Doge Base]].
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~5 seconds<sup>90f~150f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3~5 seconds<sup>90f~150f</sup>.
*10 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Doctor K.O.]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*7 [[Mega Baa Baa]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Cyberhorn]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Li'l Bun Bun]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Doctor K.O.]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Cyberhorn]] spawns after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Li'l Bun Bun]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Doctor K.O.]]s spawn after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Li'l Bun Bun]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**10 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The only thing you need to be careful of is money. If you don't level up the [[Worker Cat]] at the start, it can become an issue later on in the stage. There are no backliner threats, so the combination of [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser]], [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman]], [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier]] and Research [[Cat Combo|Combo]]s destroys this stage. In the event that your Cameraman has a low amount of + levels (lower than +20), bring [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer]] and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can]] to help with the start and Cyberhorn, as he can become an issue if you don't kill him fast enough.

==Trivia==
*Putrid Prison may have been designed specifically for [[Baby Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Cats in the Stroller]], the [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 13.5 Update|Version 13.5]] alongside [[Secluded Cavy Island]]. Cats in the Stroller has short range for an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare]] but nevertheless outranges all the melee enemies in Putrid Prison, can knockback [[Cyberhorn]] and [[Li'l Bun Bun]], excels at clearing peons using strong [[Wave Attack]]s and Omni Strike, and has a [[Talents|Talent]] that grants immunity to the Curse inflicted by [[Sir Rel]] and the [[Relic Doge Base (Enemy Base)|Relic Doge Base]].
*Prior to [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]], the stage width was set to 4,000. The change was made because of a bug in how [[:Category:Animated Enemy Bases|Animated Bases]] spawn when not set as bosses.

